==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Duche]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
In this stage, you're pretty much fighting a nerfed [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]], with the same DPS and less Omni Strikes. Stack up [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] with units that can outrange and crowd-control Bun Bun like [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necro-Dancer Cat]]. At base hit, deploy [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attack units]] like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] or [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]] to clean off peons. If you own [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]], this stage should be much easier.

==Trivia==
*Saikyo Domain is named after the Japanese word 最強 ''saikyō'' (strongest).

